ohhh man you guys should watch the videos and pay attention theres clues everywhere. I'll explain;

The "wierd looking" videos arent creepy or sinister it's just our brains arent used to seeing patterns (logarithmic spirals) on such a  grand scale all at once. The video starts by running over the surface of a cube. The cube has certain patterns and geometric shapes on it (think outside the box) the "shells" are basically a natural demonstration of the unique precision of the grand universal creator. SACRED GEOMETRY. The tree isnt a tree it's magnified fractal branching pattern of the nerve structure.

Look up the Golden Ratio.

Aztec text. 

Anagrams of the words always revealed.

The horoscopes- if you watch carefully what happens in the video and think outside the box and stop thinking of it as a puzzle and read a few books, reject basically everything you've ever thought you knew and if you are still determined then you'll forget where you even started but you wont be mad at yourself for obsessing over something. Instead you will be sitting smiling to yourself about the journey. No wrong answers just tried and tested paths.

One more thing  - who ever said the liber primus was all in English? Why not latin like the title? Also the root of the book is page 0 you might wana start there. Dont forget your compass.

